Russian Keyboard Tool

A system-wide IBus input method for Russian phonetic transliteration.
Type English QWERTY sequences and get Russian Cyrillic.

Setup after installation:
  1. Ensure IBus is your active input method framework.
  2. Run: russian-keyboard-setup
  3. Restart IBus once: ibus restart
  4. Add "Russian - Russian Keyboard" in IBus Preferences.
  5. Press Meta+R to toggle Russian input mode.

Examples:
  privet   -> привет
  khorosho -> хорошо
  zhizn    -> жизнь
  shchuka  -> щука

Documentation and source code:
  https://github.com/XexanTerxcin/Russian-Keyboard-Tool
